@startuml
actor Kaprodi
participant Client
participant ReportController as Controller
participant ReportService as Service
database DB

Client -> Controller: GET /reports/obe?prodiId=&tahunKurikulum=
Controller -> Service: generateObeReport(params)
Service -> DB: query PemetaanCplMk, NilaiCpmkMahasiswa, RekapCplMahasiswa
DB --> Service: raw data
Service -> Service: aggregate per angkatan, per MK, per CPL
Service --> Controller: reportPayload (JSON / XLSX)
Controller --> Client: 200 OK (file/JSON)

note right of Service: Report includes:
- Status pemetaan CPL/CPMK per MK
- Distribusi capaian CPL per angkatan
- Daftar MK dengan kesenjangan target vs aktual
end note

@enduml
